# 🔎 Example: Classical Shift Cipher

One of the implementations in the repository demonstrates a **shift-based substitution cipher**.

The program supports:

- Text input
- User-defined shift value
- Encryption
- Decryption
- Uppercase characters
- Lowercase characters
- Preservation of non-alphabetic characters

### Example

```text
Input:
HELLO

Shift:
3

Encrypted:
KHOOR
